{"channelId":"UCN3h51RnIRsdzL4HTp3MNRQ","row":["Alaqua Animal Refuge",382,"As the premier no-kill animal shelter and sanctuary in the Southeast, Alaqua Animal Refuge believes that every abused, neglected and homeless animal deserves a second chance. Committed to providing protection, shelter and care to animals in need, this private, 501(c)3 non-profit also offers a full-service adoption center, educational outreach, and community programs that touch a diverse constituency.\n\n Since its inception in 2007, Alaqua has been pushing the boundaries of animal welfare services, cruelty prevention, and advocacy for all animals and is a recognized leader on these issues in our region, our state, and around the U.S.—all the while rescuing, rehabilitating and finding new homes for animals of all kinds. \n\nTo learn more, visit our website at www.Alaqua.org","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCN3h51RnIRsdzL4HTp3MNRQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCN3h51RnIRsdzL4HTp3MNRQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:05:10.221Z","channelId":"UCN3h51RnIRsdzL4HTp3MNRQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"73893d999975e67568ba398c984c3bfbeba952ed1d07957ff65b4ff3a14ddc7a","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"1c1776b77f28d5866c97411f3d63be36ddc9481f2cfca4c6879308b9699ddddd"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCN3h51RnIRsdzL4HTp3MNRQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:05:10.221Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCN3h51RnIRsdzL4HTp3MNRQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":382,"raw":"382 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCN3h51RnIRsdzL4HTp3MNRQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:05:10.221Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"or